OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,FNewcastle United has confirmed that
OL,7,FEddie Howe is stepping down as head
OL,8,Fcoach.
OL,10,FThe club has said they have accepted
OL,11,Fhis decision, and have thanked him for
OL,12,Fhis "extraordinary contribution".
OL,14,FNews of Howe's departure was widely
OL,15,Freported on Thursday (30 July)
OL,16,Fmorning, but was not formally
OL,17,Fconfirmed by the club until Friday
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
