CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,FThe Magpies have also announced that
OL,7,FHowe's coaching staff, Jason Tindall,
OL,8,FGraeme Jones, Stephen Purches and
OL,9,FSimon Weatherstone, as well as head of
OL,10,Fperformance Dan Hodges, are all
OL,11,Fleaving the club as well.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, the club has issued a
OL,14,Flengthy statement from Eddie Howe
OL,15,Fhimself, in which he describes the
OL,16,Fdecision to step down as "incredibly
OL,17,Fdifficult", and has said his time in
OL,18,Fcharge at St James' Park has been "the
OL,19,Fprivilege of my lifetime".
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,FBut he concludes, "I feel that it is
OL,7,Fin the best interests of both myself
OL,8,Fand the club to step away, recharge
OL,9,Fand take a break."
OL,11,FHowe arrived at Newcastle United in
OL,12,FNovember 2021, and arguably his
OL,13,Fgreatest achievement was leading the
OL,14,Fteam to victory in the Carabao Cup in
OL,15,F2025, their first major domestic
OL,16,Ftrophy for 70 years.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,FHe also guided the Magpies to two
OL,7,FChampions League campaigns, giving
OL,8,Ffans the chance to see their team face
OL,9,FEuropean giants like Barcelona and
OL,10,FParis Saint-Germain.
OL,12,FEddie Howe said: "It is difficult to
OL,13,Fput into words what this club, the
OL,14,Fcity and its supporters mean, and will
OL,15,Falways mean, to me and my family.
OL,17,F"From the moment myself, Jason and all
OL,18,Fof the staff arrived nearly half a
OL,19,Fdecade ago, Newcastle instantly felt
OL,20,Flike home and the people here welcomed
OL,21,Fus with open arms.
OL,26,@tD@ROU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,F"We took huge pride in representing
OL,7,Fthe club from day one and this city
OL,8,Fwill always hold a very special place
OL,9,Fin our hearts.
OL,11,F"To stand on the touchline at St.
OL,12,FJames' Park as your manager with the
OL,13,Fhonour of representing your club has
OL,14,Fmeant more to me than you will ever
OL,15,Fknow.
OL,17,F"While my journey as manager has now
OL,18,Fcome to an end, the affinity and love
OL,19,FI will always hold for Newcastle
OL,20,FUnited never will.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,F"Thank you for everything. I wish the
OL,7,Fclub every success for the future."
OL,9,FDavid Hopkinson, Newcastle United's
OL,10,FCEO, paid tribute to Howe and his
OL,11,Fstaff, saying they leave "with a
OL,12,Flasting place in the club's history."
OL,14,FHe added: "While we are naturally
OL,15,Fdisappointed to see Eddie leave, we
OL,16,Fremain immensely thankful for
OL,17,Feverything he has done for the club.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,F"On behalf of our owners, Board,
OL,7,Fplayers, staff and supporters, I would
OL,8,Flike to extend sincere thanks to Eddie
OL,9,Ffor his outstanding service and
OL,10,Fleadership, and wish him and his
OL,11,Ffamily every success and happiness for
OL,12,Fthe future."
OL,14,FThoughts of Newcastle United fans are
OL,15,Fnow turning to who might succeed Howe
OL,16,Fat St James' Park.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
