PN,39708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785853117
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirms departure of
OL,4,CEddie Howe
OL,6,FIt has been widely reported that the
OL,7,FGerman-born football manager Matthias
OL,8,FJaissle is being lined up, he is
OL,9,Fcurrently head coach of the Saudi Pro
OL,10,FLeague club Al-Ahli.
OL,12,FWhile Newcastle United has not named
OL,13,Fany names, the club has confirmed that
OL,14,F"the process to recruit a new head
OL,15,Fcoach is at an advanced stage and
OL,16,Fupdates will be communicated shortly."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/8
